<title>USA: Diametrics completes private placement.</title>
<headline>Diametrics completes private placement.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diametrics Medical Inc said Thursday it completed a private placement of $12 million of Series I junior participating convertible preferred stock at $16 a share.</p>
<p>Each share of preferred will automatically convert into four shares of common stock upon shareholder approval of additional authorized common shares.</p>
<p>In addition, each purchaser will receive a warrant to buy one share of common stock, at $5.06, for each share of preferred stock purchased, providing additional future funding potential of nearly $4 million.</p>
<p>Diametrics said the financing will provide funds for the company to broaden its critical care blood analysis product line.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
